give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Roll the Dice and Die\"", "italic": true, "color": "green"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Washerwoman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Townsfolk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Librarian", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Outsider. (Or that zero are in play.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Investigator", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Minion."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Chef", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing how many pairs of evil players there are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Empath", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn how many of your 2 alive neighbors are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fortune Teller", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 players: you learn if either is a Demon. There is a good player that registers as a Demon to you."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Undertaker", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn which character died by execution today."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Monk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player (not yourself): they are safe from the Demon tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Ravenkeeper", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you die at night, you are woken to choose a player: you learn their character."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Virgin", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe 1st time you are nominated, if the nominator is a Townsfolk, they are executed immediately."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Slayer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Soldier", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou are safe from the Demon."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mayor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf only 3 players live & no execution occurs, your team wins. If you die at night, another player might die instead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Drunk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Recluse", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou might register as evil & as a Minion or Demon, even if dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Moonchild", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you learn that you died, publicly choose 1 alive player. Tonight, if it was a good player, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Barber", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Demon may choose 2 players (not another Demon) to swap characters."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poisoner", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: they are poisoned tonight and tomorrow day."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Scarlet Woman", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf there are 5 or more players alive & the Demon dies, you become the Demon. (Travellers don't count.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Baron", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nThere are extra Outsiders in play. [+2 Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Witch", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: if they nominate tomorrow, they die. If just 3 players live, you lose this ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Imp", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. If you kill yourself this way, a Minion becomes the Imp."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fang Gu", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Roll the Dice and Die Script", "italic": false, "color": "green", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Roll the Dice and Die\"", "italic": false, "color": "green"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]